      "title": "dfilter: Allow case insensitive operators",
      "message": "dfilter: Allow case insensitive operators\n\nHave flex match case-insensitive, except for the \\x, \\u, and \\U\nescape sequences, which are case-sensitive in C and C++. The other\npatterns are all either already case-insensitive explicitly, or are\noperator tokens that now will be case-insensitive.\n\nUpdate tests. Update the checks when registering filter names to\nmatch reserved operator names case-insensitively.\n",
